    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the context before improving understandability.Now I have a clear picture. The original test has a single flat method with 16 assertions and several unused imports. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing unused imports\n2. Splitting into focused, well-named test methods grouped by intent\n3. Using `@ParameterizedTest` to eliminate repetition for the 10 ASCII digit casesThe improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version removes unused imports, uses `@ParameterizedTest` to eliminate repetition across all 10 ASCII digits, and splits the non-digit cases into two clearly named methods (`asciiLettersAreNotDigits` and `nonAsciiCharactersAreNotDigits`) that communicate intent at a glance."
